flowchart TD
    A["Source or published capability"] --> B["Exact image / service registration"]
    B --> C["SELinux label, init mode, Binder contract"]
    C --> D{ "Caller identity and permission gate" }
    D -->|"accepted trusted caller"| E["User / profile / role propagation"]
    D -->|"ordinary app or shell"| X["Observed denial or provenance gap"]
    E --> F["Sensitive sink: PM, HOME, package state, OTA, credential, SELinux, partition"]
    F --> G["Impact requires complete reachability chain"]

    I["Amazon IPC service"] --> J["Stub / onTransact / facade"]
    J --> D
    K["GPL driver or procfs source"] --> L["init + node + file_context"]
    L --> M["compiled client domain"]
    M --> D
    N["Existing device evidence"] --> O["read-only state and prior mutation result"]
    O -. "does not establish a new writer" .-> D

    U["UNKNOWN caller, client, consumer, or user mapping"] -. "must not be promoted to vulnerability" .-> X
    R["Risk-rejected: unknown Binder, driver open/ioctl, OTA/recovery, Root, partition write"] -. "not executed" .-> F
